        "liquid_content": "{% comment %}\n  Busser Job Posting - Custom Liquid Section\n  Copy and paste this code directly into a Custom Liquid section in your theme editor\n{% endcomment %}\n\n<div class=\"job-posting-section\">\n  <div class=\"job-posting-container\">\n    <div class=\"job-posting__content\">\n      <div class=\"job-posting__header\">\n        <div class=\"job-posting__title-section\">\n          <h3 class=\"job-posting__title\">Busser</h3>\n          <p class=\"job-posting__details\">Full-Time • Thousand Oaks</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"job-posting__summary\">\n        <p>Join our hospitality team as a Busser and help create exceptional dining experiences for our guests. You'll be responsible for maintaining clean, welcoming spaces while supporting our servers to ensure smooth restaurant operations.</p>\n        \n        <div class=\"job-posting__highlights\">\n          <h4>What You'll Do:</h4>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Clear and reset tables efficiently between guests</li>\n            <li>Maintain cleanliness in dining areas and outdoor spaces</li>\n            <li>Assist servers with delivering food and beverages</li>\n            <li>Support kitchen and bar teams during busy periods</li>\n            <li>Help create a welcoming atmosphere for all guests</li>\n          </ul>\n          \n          <h4>What We're Looking For:</h4>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Positive attitude and strong work ethic</li>\n            <li>Ability to work in a fast-paced environment</li>\n            <li>Team player with excellent communication skills</li>\n            <li>Previous restaurant experience preferred but not required</li>\n            <li>Must be able to lift 50+ lbs and stand for extended periods</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <!-- UPDATE THIS LINKEDIN URL WITH YOUR ACTUAL JOB POSTING -->\n      <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/YOUR_BUSSER_JOB_ID\" \n         class=\"job-posting__apply-btn\" \n         target=\"_blank\">\n        <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <path d=\"M16 8C18.2091 8 20 9.79086 20 12V21H16V12C16 11.4477 15.5523 11 15 11C14.4477 11 14 11.4477 14 12V21H10V12C10 9.79086 11.7909 8 14 8H16Z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <rect x=\"6\" y=\"9\" width=\"4\" height=\"12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"6\" r=\"2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n        </svg>\n        Apply on LinkedIn\n      </a>\n      \n      <p class=\"job-posting__contact-info\">\n        Questions? Contact us at <strong>careers@thillbc.com</strong>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .job-posting-section {\n    padding: 40px 0;\n    background-color: transparent;\n    color: #333333;\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n  }\n  \n  .job-posting-container {\n    max-width: 800px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 20px;\n  }\n  \n  .job-posting__content {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    padding: 50px 40px;\n    border-radius: 15px;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;\n  }\n  \n  .job-posting__content:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-5px);\n    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n  }\n  \n  .job-posting__header {\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  \n  .job-posting__icon {\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    width: 80px;\n    height: 80px;\n    background: #f0f0f0;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  \n  .job-posting__title-section {\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n  \n  .job-posting__title {\n    font-family: 'Poppins Black', 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 36px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  \n  .job-posting__details {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #666666;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n  \n  .job-posting__summary {\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  \n  .job-posting__summary > p {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    color: #555;\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n  }\n  \n  .job-posting__highlights h4 {\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    margin: 25px 0 15px 0;\n  }\n  \n  .job-posting__highlights ul {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n  }\n  \n  .job-posting__highlights li {\n    padding: 8px 0 8px 25px;\n    position: relative;\n    color: #555;\n  }\n  \n  .job-posting__highlights li:before {\n    content: \"→\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 8px;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  \n  .job-posting__apply-btn {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    background: #1a1a1a;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    padding: 16px 32px;\n    border-radius: 25px;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  \n  .job-posting__apply-btn:hover {\n    background: #0066cc;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    transform: translateY(-2px);\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n  }\n  \n  .job-posting__contact-info {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #666666;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n    padding-top: 30px;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n  }\n  \n  /* Mobile responsive */\n  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {\n    .job-posting-section {\n      padding: 20px 0;\n    }\n    \n    .job-posting-container {\n      padding: 0 15px;\n    }\n    \n    .job-posting__content {\n      padding: 30px 20px;\n    }\n    \n    .job-posting__header {\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    \n    .job-posting__apply-btn {\n      padding: 14px 24px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      width: 100%;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n    \n    .job-posting__summary > p {\n      font-size: 16px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>"
